 "rendered": "SELECT * FROM orders MATCH_RECOGNIZE (PARTITION BY custkey ORDER BY orderdate MEASURES A.totalprice AS starting_price, LAST(B.totalprice) AS bottom_price, LAST(C.totalprice) AS top_price ONE ROW PER MATCH AFTER MATCH SKIP PAST LAST ROW PATTERN (A B+ C+ D+) DEFINE B AS totalprice < PREV(totalprice), C AS totalprice > PREV(totalprice) AND totalprice <= A.totalprice, D AS totalprice > PREV(totalprice), E AS MAX(foo) >= NEXT(bar))",
